  "post_title": "Cuatro ondenses en el podium del V Rallyslot Vila d'Onda",
  "post_date": "2014-07-23 08:37:40",
  "post_name": "cuatro-ondenses-en-el-podium-del-v-rallyslot-vila-donda",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Cuatro ondenses han subido al podium del V Rallyslot Vila d&#39;Onda, que se ha disputado este fin de semana en el Casal Jove, organizado por el Club Slot Onda, con el patrocinio del Ayuntamiento y de la Caja Rural. </span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/IMG_2076.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">El primero en hacerlo ha sido Hugo Garc&iacute;a Mu&ntilde;oz, tercero en categor&iacute;a infantil, que aparece en la foto en plena acci&oacute;n, bajo la atenta mirada su padre, su madre, del concejal de Deportes, Jos&eacute; Manuel Alfonso Broch, y de Adri&aacute;n Pallar&eacute;s Blasco, que tambi&eacute;n ha subido al podium en super N Rallys.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/IMG_2081.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">En mujeres, Mari Carmen Diago ha sido segunda y Vanessa Bono (en acci&oacute;n, en la foto) ha obtenido el tercer puesto.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ralislotvilaonda14diumenge/img_2021.jpg\" alt=\"img_2021\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ralislotvilaonda14diumenge/img_2022.jpg\" alt=\"img_2022\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ralislotvilaonda14diumenge/img_2023.jpg\" alt=\"img_2023\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ralislotvilaonda14diumenge/img_2025.jpg\" alt=\"img_2025\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ralislotvilaonda14diumenge/img_2026.jpg\" alt=\"img_2026\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ralislotvilaonda14diumenge/img_2027.jpg\" alt=\"img_2027\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ralislotvilaonda14diumenge/img_2030.jpg\" alt=\"img_2030\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ralislotvilaonda14diumenge/img_2031.jpg\" alt=\"img_2031\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ralislotvilaonda14diumenge/img_2032.jpg\" alt=\"img_2032\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ralislotvilaonda14diumenge/img_2065.jpg\" alt=\"img_2065\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ralislotvilaonda14diumenge/img_2066.jpg\" alt=\"img_2066\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ralislotvilaonda14diumenge/img_2067.jpg\" alt=\"img_2067\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ralislotvilaonda14diumenge/img_2069.jpg\" alt=\"img_2069\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ralislotvilaonda14diumenge/img_2071.jpg\" alt=\"img_2071\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ralislotvilaonda14diumenge/img_2073.jpg\" alt=\"img_2073\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.